  "setup": "Isolated `opencode serve` on a random localhost port with its own XDG config, data, state and cache directories under a new 0700 temporary directory and a minimal environment (HOME kept so the claude-agent provider uses the local Claude login; a dummy QUAL_PROBE_TOKEN variable for the shell check). claude-agent connected through its external `claude-login` method (method reference only). Project-local config loaded three plugins in order: qual-pre (recorder), runtime/adapters/opencode_plugin.ts with python/settings/ledger options pinned to the temporary routing store, qual-post (recorder and last guard before sending). The temporary directory was removed after the run.",
